Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 00:07:04 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 72/97] recoverssm: RecoverSSM for Qwen GDN and the PLE short
 conv (port of upstream #58863, 03cae7837f)

Port of the upstream vLLM change #58863 (Apache-2.0). With --use-replayssm and speculative decoding, Gated DeltaNet layers verify the
draft window from a read-only checkpoint and keep a per-token replay record; after sampling one commit replays
the accepted tokens and writes the recurrent state once. The PLE short conv gets the same treatment.
